      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحٌّ</span></b>  The <i>purest, best,</i> or <i>choicest, part of
anything.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  The <i>yolk</i> of an egg; (S, K;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحَّةٌ</span></b> : (ISh, K:) or the <i>entire contents</i>
of an egg; (K;) the <i>yolk and the white.</i>
(ISh.)

